# Digital Soup: The New ABCs of Distance Learning.

**Authors:** Douglas, Suzanne G.

## Abstract
Describes new information technologies that expand learning opportunities in higher education, both on and off campus. The impact of national data transmission facilities, a brief history of the use of educational technology, examples of applications of hybrid technology systems, partnerships with telephone companies, and the future outlook are discussed. (KRN)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ467306

